      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.3",
      "title": "Colors Requirements",
      "body": "Colors used for Tabards must be based on historical sources. Any clearly modern color is denied. (Neon pink, fluorescent yellow, etc.)\n\nFor the Marshals’ safety, the use of yellow as a main color of a Tabard is Denied. Yellow color must represent less than 50% of the Tabard colors. The combination of black and yellow must not be inspired by Marshal’s uniforms.",
