    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.4",
      "title": "Symbols and Decorations Requirements",
      "body": "Symbols and decorations used for Tabards must be based on historical sources. Any clearly modern symbol or decoration is denied. (Warhammer logo, movies or TV show imagery, modern slogan etc.)\n\nWe recommend taking inspiration from middle ages manuscripts to create your symbols.\nSymbols and decorations used for Tabards must be made with the following techniques:\n\n● embroidery,\n\n● painting: can be by hand or by stamp,\n\n● sewing a patchwork of clothes to create a design,\n● any other techniques based on historical sources.",
